<title>JAPAN: SocGen to move Asia metals desk to Sydney.</title>
<headline>SocGen to move Asia metals desk to Sydney.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Societe Generale said on Thursday it will move its Asian metals trading desk to Sydney from Tokyo at the end of February.</p>
<p>The two-person team currently focuses on making markets for precious metal derivatives in Asia, the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;Whilst the restructure demonstrates our continued commitment to the Australian resource sector, we will be maintaining our extensive relationships with counterparts in other areas of Asia,&quot; said marketing manager Andrew Dixon.</p>
<p>Also moving to Sydney will be the team's chief dealer, Christophe Renaud.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
